le=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">(0.10)</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #000000;\">\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">EF edad</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">No</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">Sí</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">Sí</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">Sí</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">R<sup>2</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.03</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.04</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.03</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">Adj. R<sup>2</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.02</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.03</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.02</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">0.02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;\">\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">Num. obs.</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">1196</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">1196</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">1561</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">867</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n<tfoot>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\" colspan=\"5\"><sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;&#42;</sup>p &lt; 0.001; <sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;</sup>p &lt; 0.01; <sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;</sup>p &lt; 0.05</td>\n</tr>\n</tfoot>\n</table>\n\n## Errores estándar agrupados\n\nEl tratamiento de los modelos 2x2 varía por celda de edad y ola, por lo que los errores que tratan cada observación como independiente pueden subestimar la incertidumbre. Como robustez, y sin reemplazar los errores de la tabla anterior, se reportan errores robustos HC1 y errores agrupados por celda (`celda = interaction(edad_nac, ola)`) con `sandwich::vcovCL`.\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\n## Errores agrupados por celda -----------------------------------------------\nmodelos_2x2 <- list(\"2x2\" = m_did_2x2, \"2x2 con EF edad\" = m_did_2x2_edad,\n                    \"2x2 con EF edad, controles sin Plan\" = m_did_2x2_edad_sinplan)\ndatos_2x2 <- list(did_2x2, did_2x2, did_2x2_sinplan)\n\nerrores_2x2 <- dplyr::bind_rows(lapply(seq_along(modelos_2x2), function(i) {\n  m <- modelos_2x2[[i]]\n  celda <- interaction(datos_2x2[[i]]$edad_nac, datos_2x2[[i]]$ola, drop = TRUE)\n  hc1 <- lmtest::coeftest(m, vcov. = sandwich::vcovHC, type = \"HC1\")[\"joven:post\", ]\n  cl <- lmtest::coeftest(m, vcov. = sandwich::vcovCL, cluster = celda, type = \"HC1\")[\"joven:post\", ]\n  data.frame(modelo = names(modelos_2x2)[i], estimacion = hc1[1],\n             ee_hc1 = hc1[2], p_hc1 = hc1[4],\n             ee_celda = cl[2], p_celda = cl[4], n_celdas = nlevels(celda))\n}))\nrownames(errores_2x2) <- NULL\n\n# Se agrega al .rds sin alterar sus elementos anteriores\nres_did_2x2 <- readRDS(\"output/models/modelos_did_interes.rds\")\nres_did_2x2$errores_agrupados <- errores_2x2\nsaveRDS(res_did_2x2, \"output/models/modelos_did_interes.rds\")\n\n## Tabla completa: cada modelo con errores HC1 y agrupados por celda ------------\ncts_errores <- unlist(lapply(seq_along(modelos_2x2), function(i) {\n  m <- modelos_2x2[[i]]\n  celda <- interaction(datos_2x2[[i]]$edad_nac, datos_2x2[[i]]$ola, drop = TRUE)\n  list(lmtest::coeftest(m, vcov. = sandwich::vcovHC, type = \"HC1\"),\n       lmtest::coeftest(m, vcov. = sandwich::vcovCL, cluster = celda, type = \"HC1\"))\n}), recursive = FALSE)\n\nargs_errores <- list(rep(modelos_2x2, each = 2),\n                     custom.model.names = paste(rep(names(modelos_2x2), each = 2), c(\"(HC1)\", \"(celda)\")),\n                     override.se = lapply(cts_errores, function(ct) ct[, 2]),\n                     override.pvalues = lapply(cts_errores, function(ct) ct[, 4]),\n                     custom.note = \"%stars. Errores estándar HC1 o agrupados por celda de edad y ola entre paréntesis.\")\n\ndo.call(texreg::htmlreg, c(args_errores, file = \"output/tables/modelo_did_interes_errores.html\"))\n```\n:::\n\n\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndo.call(texreg::htmlreg, args_errores)\n```\n\n<table class=\"texreg\" style=\"margin: 10px auto;border-collapse: collapse;border-spacing: 0px;caption-side: bottom;color: #000000;border-top: 2px solid #000000;\">\n<caption>Statistical models</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">&nbsp;</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 (HC1)</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 (celda)</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 con EF edad (HC1)</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 con EF edad (celda)</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 con EF edad, controles sin Plan (HC1)</th>\n<th style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2x2 con EF edad, controles sin Plan (celda)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"border-top: 1px solid #000000;\">\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">(Intercept)</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2.47<sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;&#42;</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2.47<sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;&#42;</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2.36<sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;&#42;</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2.36<sup class=\"texreg-stars\">&#42;&#42;&#42;</sup></td>\n<td style=\"padding-left: 5px;padding-right: 5px;\">2.36<sup class